# ==============================================================================
# Runtime data & generated artifacts
# ==============================================================================
## Checkpoints, audit logs, and any locally-generated SQLite database.
## Fixture *source* (the generator script, ground-truth.json) is TypeScript/JSON
## and is unaffected by this — only the generator's runtime *.db output is ignored.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

## Defense in depth: catches a copied/renamed chat.db backup (e.g. chat.db.bak)
## that *.db alone wouldn't match.
chat.db*

## Session transcripts / audit-log exports — may contain message content.
*.jsonl

## Eval run outputs — regenerable by re-running the eval suite from a fixed seed
evals/results/*
!evals/results/.gitkeep

# ==============================================================================
# Demo captures
# ==============================================================================
## Unedited screen recordings expose the full Messages sidebar — every
## contact name, every preview line, whatever notification lands mid-take.
## Only cropped, reviewed exports (outside this path) belong in the repo.
/demo/raw/

