logs/

# ==============================================================================
# XcodeGen
# ==============================================================================
## The Xcode project is GENERATED from ios/project.yml and is not committed.
##
## It was committed at first, so a reviewer could open it without installing
## anything. That turned out to leak: XcodeGen resolves the signing xcconfig
## and writes DEVELOPMENT_TEAM, an account identifier, straight into the
## project file. Generated artifacts also drift from their source and make
## noisy diffs. Run `xcodegen generate` in ios/ instead.
ios/Tieout.xcodeproj/

## Apple Developer team ID. Real one is local only; see ios/Signing.example.xcconfig
ios/Signing.xcconfig
